// Draft v2 projection for the import editor. It mirrors the strict Web v2 schemas (adminNamingSchema.ts), so a value a later
// release stores degrades to an empty value or a dropped item instead of failing to parse.
/** Allowlisted Artist entries (at most 20, unique UUID keys). Lenient drops an unreadable entry; strict returns null instead. */
